<title>UK: Lloyds TSB jumps after H1 results.</title>
<headline>Lloyds TSB jumps after H1 results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lloyds TSB Group Plc jumped three  percent at the open on Friday after the UK bank issued a higher-than-expected  dividend and posted profits well within analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>The shares climbed 22p to 697-1/2p at the start of trade.</p>
</text>
